        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Ground: cotton and linen; four pieces sewn together.  Design: scalloped lower edge edmbroidered with scrolling bands filled with flowers; scallops divide valance into eight compartments of which five to left contain flowering fruit trees and three to right contain exotic birds.  Worked with polychrome wools in chain stitch with a few details in French knots.  Some holes and mends, some black yarns rotted out."@en ;
